ight:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133473372.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A Michigan couple bought an abandoned 160-year-old farmhouse for $26,000 and spent nearly $320,000 bringing it back to life. Samantha and Sean Kilgore tackled the massive restoration without professional renovation experience, transforming everything from the foundation to the kitchen. Their journey turned a neglected property into a beautiful home while preserving its history and character.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/in-2018-a-young-michigan-couple-bought-an-abandoned-160-year-old-farmhouse-for-26000-with-no-renovation-experience-they-spent-about-320000-rebuilding-it/articleshow/133473372.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/in-2018-a-young-michigan-couple-bought-an-abandoned-160-year-old-farmhouse-for-26000-with-no-renovation-experience-they-spent-about-320000-rebuilding-it/articleshow/133473372.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-24T22:15:24+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Real Estate Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133473588,imgsize-119933.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[12 people arrested in connection with UK A66 crash that killed 7, including 2 police officers]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133473276.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/12-people-arrested-in-connection-with-uk-a66-crash-that-killed-7-including-2-police-officers/articleshow/133473276.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/12-people-arrested-in-connection-with-uk-a66-crash-that-killed-7-including-2-police-officers/articleshow/133473276.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-24T21:56:46+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc=